   {
    "team": "Gopher Gold",
    "line": "Gopher Gold leads Suggs to be you 7-2, but only because Vassell, Thybulle and Poeltl replaced guys who'd have made it 5-5."
   },
   {
    "team": "Da Don Da Beard & Da Klaw",
    "line": "Da Don Da Beard & Da Klaw cut Devin Vassell, who's feeding Gopher Gold's lead, to add Saddiq Bey, who is merely fine."
   },
   {
    "team": "Nova Knicks",
    "line": "Nova Knicks lead 7-2 because Cam Spencer's 27 assists and three other adds beat the guys dropped for them. Without the moves it's 5-5."
